---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Colophon · Ayaan Retiwala"
  description="Credits for the photography, typography, and sky rendering on lolwierd.com."
>
  <h1 class="page-title" slot="hero">colophon</h1>

  <section class="colophon">
    <p class="note">
      the mountain photograph is by Alexis Rodriguez, captured at Annapurna I
      in Nepal. it is used from <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/a-mountain-range-with-snow-covered-mountains-in-the-background-8eo8PsNIrNs" rel="noreferrer">Unsplash</a> under the <a href="https://unsplash.com/license" rel="noreferrer">Unsplash License</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="note note-secondary">
      the sky is drawn to the real sun, moon, and star positions over Vadodara,
      then dithered to match the photograph. the frame is treated as facing due
      south, which is the only bearing that agrees with the way the sun crosses
      it. type is Iowan Old Style.
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .colophon {
      width: min(100%, 40rem);
    }

    .note {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      font: 400 clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem) / 1.65 var(--serif);
      letter-spacing: -0.012em;
      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    .note-secondary {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--ink-faint);
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
    }
  </style>
</PageLayout>
